      "pinyin": "zhè ge dà shū xìng dèng tā shì mǎ ā yí de zhàng fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "虽然他们两人都穿着环卫工人的衣服，但是他们两人中，只有马阿姨是环卫工人。",
      "traditional": "雖然他們兩人都穿著環衛工人的衣服，但是他們兩人中，只有馬阿姨是環衛工人。",
      "pinyin": "suī rán tā men liǎng rén dōu chuān zhe huán wèi gōng rén de yī fu dàn shì tā men liǎng rén zhōng zhǐ yǒu mǎ ā yí shì huán wèi gōng rén",
      "english": "This man's name is Deng, and he is the husband of Aunt Ma."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "邓大叔白天在一个公司上班，",
      "traditional": "鄧大叔白天在一個公司上班，",
      "pinyin": "dèng dà shū bái tiān zài yí ge gōng sī shàng bān",
      "english": "Even though they both wear public sanitation worker clothes, among the two only Aunt Ma is a sanitation worker."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "下了班后，他马上赶来换上环卫衣服的原因只有一个：",
      "traditional": "下了班後，他馬上趕來換上環衛衣服的原因只有一個：",
      "pinyin": "xià le bān hòu tā mǎ shàng gǎn lái huàn shàng huán wèi yī fu de yuán yīn zhǐ yǒu yí ge",
      "english": "During the day, Uncle Deng works at a company."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老婆累得脚疼，他来帮忙。",
      "traditional": "老婆累得腳疼，他來幫忙。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po lèi de jiǎo téng tā lái bāng máng",
      "english": "There is just one single reason he rushes to change to worker clothes as soon as he gets off work:"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "His wife is tired and her legs hurt, so he goes to help her."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "邓大叔和马阿姨两人一起打扫卫生，相亲相爱的视频被传到网上，",
      "traditional": "鄧大叔和馬阿姨兩人一起打掃衛生，相親相愛的視頻被傳到網上，",
