      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "网友们都很感动，说：“这才是最美的爱情。”",
      "traditional": "網友們都很感動，說：“這才是最美的愛情。”",
      "pinyin": "wǎng yǒu men dōu hěn gǎn dòng shuō zhè cái shì zuì měi de ài qíng",
      "english": "A video of Uncle Deng and Aunt Ma sweeping the streets together deeply in love reached the internet."
    }
