      "The Most Beautiful Love",
      "",
      "Recently, a man sweeping the streets by the Xihu lake went viral!",
      "",
      "This man's name is Deng, and he is the husband of Aunt Ma.",
      "Even though they both wear public sanitation worker clothes, among the two only Aunt Ma is a sanitation worker.",
      "During the day, Uncle Deng works at a company.",
      "There is just one single reason he rushes to change to worker clothes as soon as he gets off work:",
      "His wife is tired and her legs hurt, so he goes to help her.",
      "",
      "A video of Uncle Deng and Aunt Ma sweeping the streets together deeply in love reached the internet.",
      "The netizens were all moved, saying: “This is the most beautiful true love!”"
